    "body": "## Context\n\nThe `createDiscussion` GraphQL mutation does not support adding labels at creation time. This was deferred from #13316 to keep that PR focused on the core `Create` mutation.\n\n## Work needed\n\n1. Resolve label names → label IDs via a repo labels query\n2. Call `addLabelsToLabelable` mutation after the discussion is created (passing the created discussion node ID)\n3. Surface a `--label` flag in `gh discussion create`\n\nFollows pattern used by `gh issue create --label`.",
